<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?><rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" version="2.0"><channel><title>World News, Today World News, Latest International News, World Breaking News, Trending News of World - Times of India</title><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world</link><description>World News Today: Read the latest world news headlines, Current International breaking news world wide. In depth analysis and top news headlines world wide.</description><language>en-gb</language><lastBuildDate>2026-07-29T02:54:44+05:30</lastBuildDate><atom:link type="application/rss+xml" rel="self" href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/rssfeeds/296589292.cms"/><copyright>Copyright:(C) Wed, 29 Jul 2026 02:54:44 IST Bennett Coleman &amp; Co. Ltd, http://in.indiatimes.com/policyterms/1554651.cms</copyright><docs>http://syndication.indiatimes.com/</docs><image><title>World News, Today World News, Latest International News, World Breaking News, Trending News of World - Times of India</title><url>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/507610.cms</url><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world</link></image><item><title><![CDATA[Kai Cenat defends Tyla from alleged catcaller during Disney World livestream, fans applaud response]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/132694420.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Twitch streamer Kai Cenat defended singer Tyla from a man during a Disney World livestream.  He confronted the individual who was allegedly shouting at the singer.  The brief exchange was captured on the livestream and quickly went viral online.  Fans praised Kai for his respectful and mature handling of the uncomfortable situation.  The livestream also marked the reunion of Kai and Tyla after nearly two years.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/kai-cenat-defends-tyla-from-alleged-catcaller-during-disney-world-livestream-fans-applaud-response/articleshow/132694420.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/kai-cenat-defends-tyla-from-alleged-catcaller-during-disney-world-livestream-fans-applaud-response/articleshow/132694420.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-07-29T02:11:46+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Sumit Roy</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-132694416,imgsize-734947.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Quote of the day by Elif Shafak: 'Do not go with the flow. Be the flow' and how to break passivity]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/132694404.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/quote-of-the-day-by-elif-shafak-do-not-go-with-the-flow-be-the-flow-and-how-to-break-passivity/articleshow/132694404.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/quote-of-the-day-by-elif-shafak-do-not-go-with-the-flow-be-the-flow-and-how-to-break-passivity/articleshow/132694404.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-07-29T02:10:47+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-132694412,imgsize-93328.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Twitch streamer NateDeBaiits heartbroken after fatal California birthday party shooting claims friend's life]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/132694239.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[A birthday party for Twitch streamer NateDeBaiits tragically ended with a shooting. One person died and six others sustained injuries during the California event.  The deceased was identified as Desiderio Romero V, a close friend of the streamer.  Police are investigating the incident which occurred after a fight broke out.  No arrests have been made as authorities review evidence.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/twitch-streamer-natedebaiits-heartbroken-after-fatal-california-birthday-party-shooting-claims-friends-life/articleshow/132694239.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/twitch-streamer-natedebaiits-heartbroken-after-fatal-california-birthday-party-shooting-claims-friends-life/articleshow/132694239.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-07-29T01:23:05+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Sumit Roy</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-132694234,imgsize-392828.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Trump, Zelenskyy discuss Patriot production, Russia peace talks at White House]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/132694259.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[US President Trump and President Zelenskyy met to discuss Ukraine's defense capabilities. They focused on expanding Patriot missile interceptor production and defense cooperation. The leaders also explored efforts to restart stalled peace talks with Russia. Ukraine's president described the meeting as positive and productive for future support. This visit coincided with Senator Lindsey Graham's funeral and a sanctions push.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/donald-trump-zelenskyy-discuss-patriot-production-russia-peace-talks-at-white-house/articleshow/132694259.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/donald-trump-zelenskyy-discuss-patriot-production-russia-peace-talks-at-white-house/articleshow/132694259.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-07-29T01:29:06+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-132694284,imgsize-86812.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Trump, Netanyahu hold 'excellent' White House meeting as Iran differences come into focus]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/132694110.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[US President Trump and Prime Minister Netanyahu met at the White House to discuss Iran.  Both leaders sought to manage differences over the future course of the conflict.  They also discussed implementing a US-Israel framework agreement with Lebanon.  Discussions also covered expanding the Abraham Accords and Gaza stabilization efforts.  Both leaders face domestic political challenges and changing regional dynamics.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/donald-trump-netanyahu-meet-at-white-house-as-iran-differences-come-into-focus/articleshow/132694110.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/donald-trump-netanyahu-meet-at-white-house-as-iran-differences-come-into-focus/articleshow/132694110.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-07-29T01:11:26+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-132694124,imgsize-123812.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Quote of the day by Lao Tzu: 'Truthful words are not beautiful; beautiful words are not truthful' and a philosophy that can't be lied to]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/132693960.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/china/quote-of-the-day-by-lao-tzu-truthful-words-are-not-beautiful-beautiful-words-are-not-truthful-and-a-